---
interface Props { view: 'overview' | 'signals' | 'summary'; }
const { view } = Astro.props;
---

<section class:list={['dashboard-detail-screen', `dashboard-view-${view}`]} aria-label="Productivity dashboard">
  {view === 'overview' && <><header><div><small>PRODUCTIVITY OVERVIEW</small><b>Workplace signals</b></div><span>This week</span></header><div class="dashboard-metric-row"><article><small>Focused time</small><b>124h</b><span>+12% this week</span></article><article><small>Projects on track</small><b>18</b><span>3 need review</span></article><article><small>Focus rate</small><b>74%</b><span>+6% this week</span></article></div><div class="dashboard-chart"><header><b>Work distribution</b><small>By project</small></header>{[['Northstar platform','78%'],['Q3 launch','61%'],['Client delivery','44%']].map(([name,value]) => <p><span>{name}</span><i><em style={`--width:${value}`}></em></i><b>{value}</b></p>)}</div></>}
  {view === 'signals' && <><header><div><small>ATTENTION SIGNALS</small><b>What changed</b></div><span>Live</span></header><div class="dashboard-signal"><i></i><div><b>Focus time increased</b><p>Design and development work rose 14% after fewer context switches.</p></div><strong>Explore</strong></div><div class="dashboard-signal"><i></i><div><b>Delivery workload is rising</b><p>Two projects are approaching their planned review window this week.</p></div><strong>Review</strong></div><div class="dashboard-signal"><i></i><div><b>Project handoff is active</b><p>Client delivery time is increasing across the account team.</p></div><strong>Open</strong></div></>}
  {view === 'summary' && <><header><div><small>WORK SUMMARY</small><b>This week's narrative</b></div><span>AI-assisted</span></header><div class="dashboard-summary"><span>✦</span><div><b>Progress is strongest across launch preparation.</b><p>Teams completed core design reviews, moved the authentication work forward, and began client handoff preparation.</p></div></div><div class="dashboard-summary-list"><p><span>Projects</span><b>Northstar platform and Q3 launch received the most focused effort.</b></p><p><span>Workload</span><b>Delivery work increased while planned work stayed balanced.</b></p></div></>}
</section>
